@startuml
[*] --> Page_Loaded

Page_Loaded : Display default content
Page_Loaded --> Content_Type_Selected : select content type

Content_Type_Selected : Show content selection options
Content_Type_Selected --> Content_Displayed : display content

Content_Displayed : Show selected content
Content_Displayed --> Content_Type_Selected : select different content type
Content_Displayed --> [*] : exit

Content_Type_Selected --> Page_Loaded : cancel selection

Page_Loaded --> [*] : exit
@enduml
